{"term": "隐匿", "aliases": ["迷彩"], "short_def": "一种特殊状态，通常令单位不可被敌方选为常规索敌目标；被阻挡或受反隐抑制时会破隐。", "mechanic_def": "由隐匿buff提供的异常状态效果，底层采用01开关机制供索敌检测以避免遍历buff列表；反隐为对该状态的抑制而非消除buff；阻挡反隐无延迟，阻挡解隐特性配置在buff内部，破隐复原时间取决于机制类型（1帧或3秒）；隐匿存在阵营区别，同阵营敌对敌无视隐匿。", "related_terms": ["反隐", "异常状态检测", "索敌", "阻挡反隐"], "source_window_ids": ["w000119", "w000387", "w000388"], "status": "glossary_draft", "needs_more_evidence": false, "linked_doc_ids": ["canonical:c0024", "canonical:c0027", "canonical:c0044", "canonical:c0048", "window:w000119", "window:w000387", "window:w000388", "window:w000446", "window:w000506", "window:w000522", "window:w000607", "window:w000679", "window:w000741", "window:w000956", "window:w000957", "window:w001198", "window:w001530", "window:w001727", "window:w001993", "window:w000079", "window:w000220", "window:w000573", "window:w000605", "window:w001151", "window:w001178", "window:w001348", "window:w001480", "window:w001510", "window:w001569", "window:w001618"], "canonical_term": "隐匿"}
{"term": "迷彩", "aliases": [], "short_def": "一种使自身不被敌人常规索敌选中的保护机制，常用于规避单体伤害，但特定机制或间隙仍可能被锁定。", "mechanic_def": "一种影响目标可选性的特殊状态，能使单位规避常规索敌。在结算逻辑中，落地迷彩的生效时机取决于具体单位（部分干员落地即生效，部分存在延迟）；且由于帧内各实体按顺序结算，同一帧内状态切换可能因实体处理先后而出现被敌方索敌插入的间隙。", "related_terms": ["可选性", "无法选中", "索敌帧", "隐匿"], "source_window_ids": ["w000506", "w000679", "w001993"], "status": "glossary_draft", "needs_more_evidence": false, "linked_doc_ids": ["canonical:c0024", "canonical:c0044", "canonical:c0048", "window:w000506", "window:w000679", "window:w001993", "window:w000079", "window:w000573", "window:w000605", "window:w001151", "window:w001178", "window:w001348", "window:w001510", "window:w001569", "window:w001618", "window:w001679", "window:w001824", "window:w001846", "window:w002030", "window:w002064"], "canonical_term": "迷彩"}
{"term": "反隐", "aliases": [], "short_def": "破除敌人隐匿状态、使其能被阻挡或作为远程攻击目标的机制。", "mechanic_def": "使敌方失去隐匿状态的效果。以银灰为例，其天赋表现为周期性施加带有持续时间的反隐状态（如每0.5秒施加持续1秒的反隐效果），真银斩攻击动作结束后也会给自己挂上该效果。", "related_terms": ["真银斩", "隐匿", "风雪之眼"], "source_window_ids": ["w000317", "w000956", "w001530"], "status": "glossary_draft", "needs_more_evidence": false, "linked_doc_ids": ["canonical:c0024", "canonical:c0027", "canonical:c0048", "window:w000317", "window:w000387", "window:w000607", "window:w000956", "window:w001530", "window:w001727", "window:w001737", "window:w001740", "window:w002030"], "canonical_term": "反隐"}
{"term": "罚站", "aliases": [], "short_def": "指敌方单位按路线预设在原地停留、不主动前行的待机状态。玩家常趁机提前削减其血量。", "mechanic_def": "敌人处于停留在原地不移动的特定行动状态（执行非移动类等待/路径点）。此时其实际移速为0，但内部仍具有理论移速属性，在判定一帧可达半径等机制时仍依其理论移速计算。", "related_terms": ["一帧可达半径", "理论移速", "路径点", "阻挡偏移"], "source_window_ids": ["w000060", "w000088", "w000251"], "status": "glossary_draft", "needs_more_evidence": false, "linked_doc_ids": ["canonical:c0013", "canonical:c0014", "canonical:c0017", "canonical:c0036", "window:w000060", "window:w000061", "window:w000088", "window:w000089", "window:w000251", "window:w000820", "window:w000959", "window:w001029", "window:w001222", "window:w001366", "window:w001465", "window:w001586", "window:w001725", "window:w001556", "window:w001584"], "canonical_term": "罚站"}
{"term": "路径点", "aliases": [], "short_def": "敌人在地图行进路线中的判定标记点，用于规划移动路线、到达后切换下一动作或阶段。", "mechanic_def": "敌人行进路线上的判定坐标节点。敌人移动判定到达到该点后顺延执行下一指令；其坐标可配置 reachOffset 偏移以支持非格子中心位置；在移动速度极快（一帧可达）时，单位寻路会直接瞬移吸附到路径点。", "related_terms": ["到达偏移", "寻路", "瞬移吸附"], "source_window_ids": ["w000061", "w000104", "w000144"], "status": "glossary_draft", "needs_more_evidence": false, "linked_doc_ids": ["canonical:c0008", "canonical:c0013", "canonical:c0014", "canonical:c0025", "canonical:c0036", "canonical:c0037", "canonical:c0039", "canonical:c0040", "canonical:c0050", "window:w000060", "window:w000061", "window:w000088", "window:w000089", "window:w000104", "window:w000144", "window:w000236", "window:w000282", "window:w000547", "window:w000550", "window:w000959", "window:w001195", "window:w001205", "window:w001214", "window:w001222", "window:w001259", "window:w001296", "window:w001311", "window:w001312", "window:w001313", "window:w001314"], "canonical_term": "路径点"}
{"term": "出怪", "aliases": [], "short_def": "指关卡中敌人或实体刷新的过程。因生成与提示等操作会占用游戏帧，实际刷新时间会在配置间隔基础上产生帧级顺延。", "mechanic_def": "游戏机制为一帧生成一个敌人（或箱子等同类实体）。配置表中的时间实际为出怪间隔而非独立绝对时间；生成操作、弹窗、路线及红黄线等表现会占用帧，导致后续怪物或实体的实际出场时间产生依次顺延/累加的帧级偏移。", "related_terms": ["出怪间隔", "帧偏移", "生成帧"], "source_window_ids": ["w000319", "w001092", "w000375"], "status": "glossary_draft", "needs_more_evidence": false, "linked_doc_ids": ["window:w000319", "window:w000375", "window:w000376", "window:w000380", "window:w000510", "window:w000796", "window:w001028", "window:w001040", "window:w001092", "window:w001139", "window:w001140", "window:w001181", "window:w002077", "window:w002078", "window:w002079", "window:w002080", "window:w000572", "window:w000573", "window:w001298", "window:w001308", "window:w001374"], "canonical_term": "出怪"}
{"term": "费用尺", "aliases": [], "short_def": "玩家利用游戏内费用条的自然充能进度来辅助精确测算、对齐操作帧数的参照工具。", "mechanic_def": "一种基于部署费用自然回复条（冷却制显示）进行时间采样的帧数判定与对齐工具。底层中费用自然回复每帧扣减0.0333333冷却，右端点对齐0冷却、左端点对齐29/30，大于29/30表现为空费帧；由于浮点误差累积导致10到11费耗时31帧，费用尺不可在前10费校准，且不能作为全局计时器。", "related_terms": ["冷却制", "空费帧", "费用回复冷却"], "source_window_ids": ["w000598", "w001127", "w000073"], "status": "glossary_draft", "needs_more_evidence": false, "linked_doc_ids": ["window:w000073", "window:w000505", "window:w000561", "window:w000598", "window:w001127"], "canonical_term": "费用尺"}
{"term": "阻挡偏移", "aliases": [], "short_def": "指干员阻挡敌人时，敌人坐标被轻微拉扯或挤压移位的现象（约0.2格）。", "mechanic_def": "当单位阻挡敌人时产生的坐标位置调整判定（通常认为作用幅度/范围约为0.2格）。阻挡可能将敌人拉扯或挤压调整至阻挡点周围（如将0.2半径外的目标拉入0.2以内），甚至可能因此将敌人挤进墙体等不可通行地块。", "related_terms": ["不可通行地块", "罚站", "路径点"], "source_window_ids": ["w000060", "w000075", "w000081"], "status": "glossary_draft", "needs_more_evidence": false, "linked_doc_ids": ["canonical:c0008", "canonical:c0012", "canonical:c0013", "canonical:c0025", "canonical:c0049", "window:w000060", "window:w000075", "window:w000081", "window:w000209", "window:w000276", "window:w000487", "window:w000521", "window:w000802", "window:w001027", "window:w001235", "window:w001251", "window:w001358", "window:w001473", "window:w001493", "window:w001580", "window:w001775", "window:w001779", "window:w001809", "window:w000074", "window:w001408", "window:w001557", "window:w001652"], "canonical_term": "阻挡偏移"}
{"term": "急停半径", "aliases": [], "short_def": "指位移类干员（如拉特种）在拖拽敌人时判定停止位移的作用半径。", "mechanic_def": "游戏底层直接写入截断的四位浮点数值：拉特种急停半径真值为 float(0.6708)（对应根号0.45）。", "related_terms": ["拉特种", "阻挡半径"], "source_window_ids": ["w001321"], "status": "glossary_draft", "needs_more_evidence": false, "linked_doc_ids": ["window:w001321"], "canonical_term": "急停半径"}
{"term": "寻路", "aliases": [], "short_def": "指敌方或召唤物等单位在地图上规划移动路线、避开障碍物与计算坐标位移的底层逻辑。", "mechanic_def": "单位在移动过程中规划路线与避障的底层逻辑。包含三帧避障机制，计算受速度方向、寻路坐标及单位挤压影响；底层曾因浮点数（float）精度粗糙及向下取整导致临界点判定波动，后续已改为定点数表示以避免精度变化。", "related_terms": ["三帧避障", "定点数", "挤压寻路"], "source_window_ids": ["w000213", "w000283", "w000548"], "status": "glossary_draft", "needs_more_evidence": false, "linked_doc_ids": ["canonical:c0008", "canonical:c0009", "canonical:c0010", "canonical:c0019", "canonical:c0025", "canonical:c0036", "canonical:c0037", "canonical:c0038", "canonical:c0039", "canonical:c0040", "canonical:c0050", "canonical:c0051", "window:w000072", "window:w000143", "window:w000144", "window:w000213", "window:w000251", "window:w000256", "window:w000263", "window:w000274", "window:w000283", "window:w000374", "window:w000432", "window:w000435", "window:w000446", "window:w000519", "window:w000521", "window:w000547", "window:w000548", "window:w000551"], "canonical_term": "寻路"}
{"term": "阻挡", "aliases": [], "short_def": "我方单位截停敌方移动的互动状态；被眩晕的敌方不会脱离阻挡，且阻挡状态本身不改变干员的索敌帧。", "mechanic_def": "unknown（卡内仅讨论了阻挡不影响索敌帧、敌方眩晕不脱离阻挡，以及同帧阻挡与索敌会插入结算，未给出阻挡的完整底层机制定义）", "related_terms": ["插入结算", "眩晕", "索敌帧", "脱离阻挡"], "source_window_ids": ["w000012", "w000318", "w000411"], "status": "glossary_draft", "needs_more_evidence": true, "linked_doc_ids": ["canonical:c0008", "canonical:c0009", "canonical:c0012", "canonical:c0013", "canonical:c0018", "canonical:c0022", "canonical:c0023", "canonical:c0025", "canonical:c0027", "canonical:c0029", "canonical:c0047", "canonical:c0052", "canonical:c0049", "canonical:c0053", "window:w000012", "window:w000013", "window:w000060", "window:w000075", "window:w000081", "window:w000111", "window:w000208", "window:w000209", "window:w000247", "window:w000253", "window:w000254", "window:w000256", "window:w000276", "window:w000315", "window:w000318", "window:w000387"], "canonical_term": "阻挡"}
{"term": "索敌", "aliases": [], "short_def": "指单位在攻击范围内寻找并选定有效目标的判定过程，决定攻击打在谁身上。", "mechanic_def": "单位按固定周期或规则搜索并选定攻击/技能目标的判定逻辑。其机制完全确定无误差；部分逻辑分步执行（如先决定锁人再决定锁谁），中间可被阻挡等同帧事件插入结算；特定单位具备固定索敌循环（如棋子3帧、跟子4帧）且可在索敌成功同帧出伤。", "related_terms": ["同帧出伤", "插入结算", "索敌循环", "阻挡"], "source_window_ids": ["w000012", "w000168", "w000250"], "status": "glossary_draft", "needs_more_evidence": false, "linked_doc_ids": ["canonical:c0017", "canonical:c0022", "canonical:c0029", "canonical:c0030", "canonical:c0031", "canonical:c0034", "canonical:c0035", "canonical:c0041", "canonical:c0042", "canonical:c0045", "canonical:c0046", "canonical:c0047", "canonical:c0052", "canonical:c0043", "canonical:c0044", "canonical:c0048", "canonical:c0049", "canonical:c0053", "window:w000012", "window:w000013", "window:w000031", "window:w000038", "window:w000044", "window:w000063", "window:w000127", "window:w000141", "window:w000168", "window:w000216", "window:w000236", "window:w000250"], "canonical_term": "索敌"}
{"term": "嘲讽", "aliases": ["嘲讽等级"], "short_def": "让角色或敌人更容易（或更难）被攻击的机制，本质是通过极大幅度改变仇恨数值来优先索敌。", "mechanic_def": "改变单位索敌优先级的机制。底层通过提供高额仇恨数值（或等级，上限2、下限-2）参与排序；角色类按时间计算仇恨并乘以1000，敌人类按路径计算仇恨，同仇恨时采用双权排序比较部署顺序。角色与敌人类仇恨计算的数量级差异可能导致嘲讽异常或失效。", "related_terms": ["仇恨", "双权排序", "索敌"], "source_window_ids": ["w000044", "w000083", "w000329"], "status": "glossary_draft", "needs_more_evidence": false, "linked_doc_ids": ["canonical:c0028", "canonical:c0041", "canonical:c0042", "canonical:c0043", "canonical:c0044", "window:w000038", "window:w000044", "window:w000083", "window:w000324", "window:w000325", "window:w000329", "window:w000392", "window:w000654", "window:w001441", "window:w001445", "window:w001523", "window:w001914", "window:w002052", "window:w000021", "window:w000430", "window:w000602", "window:w000761", "window:w001371", "window:w001437", "window:w001439", "window:w001521", "window:w001522", "window:w001524", "window:w001525", "window:w001526"], "canonical_term": "嘲讽"}
{"term": "弹道", "aliases": ["弹道定义"], "short_def": "指远程攻击发射出的飞行物。它带有伤害数据，击中目标才结算伤害，因而会导致伤害延迟生效。", "mechanic_def": "弹道本质是一个包含倍率等属性的独立数据包；在实现上可通过碰撞及碰撞数检测目标，且发出后其自带参数不受后续造伤前附属事件的影响，但飞行过程会导致出伤帧不稳定。", "related_terms": ["出伤帧", "前摇", "碰撞数"], "source_window_ids": ["w000053", "w000240", "w000261"], "status": "glossary_draft", "needs_more_evidence": false, "linked_doc_ids": ["canonical:c0016", "canonical:c0033", "canonical:c0034", "canonical:c0040", "canonical:c0048", "window:w000053", "window:w000064", "window:w000077", "window:w000105", "window:w000141", "window:w000144", "window:w000240", "window:w000261", "window:w000330", "window:w000363", "window:w000398", "window:w000420", "window:w000469", "window:w000487", "window:w000493", "window:w000511", "window:w000530", "window:w000533", "window:w000563", "window:w000618", "window:w000659", "window:w000759", "window:w000780", "window:w000957", "window:w001194"], "canonical_term": "弹道"}
{"term": "攻速", "aliases": [], "short_def": "决定干员出手快慢的属性。攻速变动会缩放攻击动画长度，但抬手后改变攻速不影响当次攻击，且动画缩放存在固定下限。", "mechanic_def": "影响攻击动作播放速度与攻击持续时间的机制属性。在服从动画与攻速时，攻击动画长度会在上下限范围内拉伸或压缩；动画播放速度下限统一为0.1倍（对应3帧动画，前摇1-2帧，连击及后摇保底各1帧，产生3-4帧攻击间隔）。已抬手的攻击不会因后续攻速变动而缩短当前攻击动画。", "related_terms": ["前摇", "动画下限", "后摇", "攻击冷却", "攻击持续"], "source_window_ids": ["w000484", "w000509", "w000600"], "status": "glossary_draft", "needs_more_evidence": false, "linked_doc_ids": ["canonical:c0017", "canonical:c0028", "canonical:c0031", "canonical:c0032", "canonical:c0034", "canonical:c0046", "window:w000082", "window:w000129", "window:w000130", "window:w000270", "window:w000271", "window:w000465", "window:w000483", "window:w000484", "window:w000509", "window:w000522", "window:w000544", "window:w000592", "window:w000600", "window:w000664", "window:w000668", "window:w000677", "window:w001132", "window:w001185", "window:w001373", "window:w001520", "window:w001586", "window:w001768", "window:w001931", "window:w001938"], "canonical_term": "攻速"}
{"term": "爆条", "aliases": [], "short_def": "指单位累积的损伤量填满特定计量条后，瞬间触发负面效果或特殊机制的现象。", "mechanic_def": "单位受到损伤（如基于攻击力累积的损伤）累积达到特定阈值（卡片提及1000损伤等边界）时触发的状态爆发。受损伤抵抗（如×0.7）影响；部分机制在爆条瞬间对单单位可触发0帧撤退，但多单位时可能失效。", "related_terms": ["0帧撤退", "损伤", "损伤抵抗"], "source_window_ids": ["w000300", "w000921", "w001022"], "status": "glossary_draft", "needs_more_evidence": false, "linked_doc_ids": ["canonical:c0007", "window:w000254", "window:w000300", "window:w000847", "window:w000921", "window:w001022", "window:w001023", "window:w001236", "window:w001878", "window:w000245", "window:w000905", "window:w001039", "window:w001245", "window:w001337", "window:w001394", "window:w001481", "window:w001506", "window:w001947", "window:w002035", "window:w002051", "window:w000872", "window:w001946"], "canonical_term": "爆条"}
